From: Benjamin Larsson <benjamin.larsson@genexis.eu>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: descend into airoha/ for NET_ECONET

The EcoNet EN751221 ethernet driver (econet-eth) lives in
drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/ but is independent of the Airoha vendor
driver. Descend into the directory when only NET_ECONET is enabled so the
EcoNet driver builds without requiring NET_VENDOR_AIROHA. The guard avoids
adding the subdirectory twice when both symbols are set.

Signed-off-by: Benjamin Larsson <benjamin.larsson@genexis.eu>
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/Makefile
@@ -12,5 +12,8 @@ obj-$(CONFIG_NET_VENDOR_AGERE) += agere/
 obj-$(CONFIG_NET_VENDOR_AIROHA) += airoha/
+ifndef CONFIG_NET_VENDOR_AIROHA
+obj-$(CONFIG_NET_ECONET) += airoha/
+endif
 obj-$(CONFIG_NET_VENDOR_ALACRITECH) += alacritech/
 obj-$(CONFIG_NET_VENDOR_ALLWINNER) += allwinner/
 obj-$(CONFIG_NET_VENDOR_ALTEON) += alteon/
